<div>
    <h3>2019年各省各批次录取查询一览及西电2019年录取时间表</h3>
   <div class="time"><span>发布时间：</span>2019-07-09 09:06:00<span>来源：</span>
    <span> 点击：</span><script>_showDynClicks("wbnews", 1482657449, 6531)</script></div>

    
    <div id="vsb_content"><div class="v_news_content">
<h2>
	<span style="color:#008000;">高考录取总流程</span></h2>
<span style="font-size:14px;"><span helvetica neue", helvetica, "hiragino sans gb", "microsoft yahei", "apple color emoji", "emoji symbols font", "segoe ui symbol", arial, sans-serif; text-align: justify;" style="color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-family: ">所有录取结果，均需要学校与各省招办在录取系统上交互完成。各省招办在进行西安电子科技大学各批次录取时，大致按照<strong>艺术类、提前批、国家专项、高校专项、普通一批、预科</strong>的顺序录取。</span></span><br />
<img src="/__local/5/4D/5B/00AD428DE02C11857B4DA30F69D_C839548F_FE.vsb?e="><br />
<h2>
	<span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 0);">高考录取时间统计表</span></h2>
<span style="font-size:14px;"><span helvetica neue", helvetica, "hiragino sans gb", "microsoft yahei", "apple color emoji", "emoji symbols font", "segoe ui symbol", arial, sans-serif; text-align: justify;" style="color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-family: ">为方便考生查询录取结果，我校根据各省录取文件，整理了各批次录取时间的统计表，<strong>可供大家参考</strong>，但实际录取进度可能会有误差。如果想第一时间查询到录取结果，还请大家关注各省招办的网站，</span><strong><span style="color:#ff0000;"><span helvetica neue", helvetica, "hiragino sans gb", "microsoft yahei", "apple color emoji", "emoji symbols font", "segoe ui symbol", arial, sans-serif; text-align: justify;" style="font-family: ">具体时间以考试院公布为准</span></span></strong><span helvetica neue", helvetica, "hiragino sans gb", "microsoft yahei", "apple color emoji", "emoji symbols font", "segoe ui symbol", arial, sans-serif; text-align: justify;" style="color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-family: ">。</span></span><br />
<img src="/__local/5/4D/5B/00AD428DE02C11857B4DA30F69D_C839548F_FE.vsb?e="><br />
<img src="/__local/5/4D/5B/00AD428DE02C11857B4DA30F69D_C839548F_FE.vsb?e="><br />
<h2>
	<span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 0);">录取结果查询方式</span></h2>
<h3>
	1.通过官网查询</h3>
<span style="font-size:14px;"><strong>Step 1</strong><br />
<span helvetica neue", helvetica, "hiragino sans gb", "microsoft yahei", "apple color emoji", "emoji symbols font", "segoe ui symbol", arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 1.8px; text-align: justify;" style="color: rgb(0, 49, 61); font-family: ">登录西安电子科技大学本科招生信息网，点击右侧的<strong>高考录取结果查询</strong></span></span><br />
<img src="/__local/5/4D/5B/00AD428DE02C11857B4DA30F69D_C839548F_FE.vsb?e="><br />
<span style="font-size:14px;"><strong>Step 2</strong><br />
<span helvetica neue", helvetica, "hiragino sans gb", "microsoft yahei", "apple color emoji", "emoji symbols font", "segoe ui symbol", arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 1.8px; text-align: justify;" style="color: rgb(0, 49, 61); font-family: ">输入考生号和身份证号，点击下方<strong>查询</strong>进行查询</span></span><br />
<img src="/__local/5/4D/5B/00AD428DE02C11857B4DA30F69D_C839548F_FE.vsb?e="><br />
<h3>
	2.通过公众号查询</h3>
<span style="font-size:14px;"><strong>Step 1</strong><br />
<span helvetica neue", helvetica, "hiragino sans gb", "microsoft yahei", "apple color emoji", "emoji symbols font", "segoe ui symbol", arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 1.8px; text-align: justify;" style="color: rgb(0, 49, 61); font-family: ">在微信中搜索公众号</span><strong><span helvetica neue", helvetica, "hiragino sans gb", "microsoft yahei", "apple color emoji", "emoji symbols font", "segoe ui symbol", arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 1.8px; text-align: justify;" style="color: rgb(0, 49, 61); font-family: ">西电招生办</span>，</strong><span helvetica neue", helvetica, "hiragino sans gb", "microsoft yahei", "apple color emoji", "emoji symbols font", "segoe ui symbol", arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 1.8px; text-align: justify;" style="color: rgb(0, 49, 61); font-family: ">点击并关注</span></span><br />
<img src="/__local/5/4D/5B/00AD428DE02C11857B4DA30F69D_C839548F_FE.vsb?e="><br />
<span style="font-size:14px;"><strong>Step 2</strong><br />
<span helvetica neue", helvetica, "hiragino sans gb", "microsoft yahei", "apple color emoji", "emoji symbols font", "segoe ui symbol", arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 1.8px; text-align: justify;" style="color: rgb(0, 49, 61); font-family: ">进入公众号后先点击右下角的<strong>招生咨询</strong>，再点击菜单栏中的第一项<strong>高考录取结果查询</strong></span></span><br />
<img src="/__local/5/4D/5B/00AD428DE02C11857B4DA30F69D_C839548F_FE.vsb?e="><br />
<span style="font-size:14px;"><strong>Step 3</strong><br />
<span helvetica neue", helvetica, "hiragino sans gb", "microsoft yahei", "apple color emoji", "emoji symbols font", "segoe ui symbol", arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 1.8px; text-align: justify;" style="color: rgb(0, 49, 61); font-family: ">输入考生号和身份证号，点击下方<strong>查询</strong>进行查询</span></span><br />
<img src="/__local/5/4D/5B/00AD428DE02C11857B4DA30F69D_C839548F_FE.vsb?e="><br />
<h3>
	3.通过电话查询</h3>
<h4>
	<span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="color:#daa520;">欢迎拨打下方电话</span></span></h4>
<h4>
	<span style="font-size:12px;">本科生招生办公室电话</span></h4>
<span style="font-size:12px;"><strong>029-88202335</strong></span><br />
</div></div><div id="div_vote_id"></div>
